# The first tick: nothing held.
tick
# W held across ticks.
key down W
tick 2
key up W
tick
# A tap between two ticks: pressed and released, and not down.
key W
tick
# Two taps between two ticks: two of each event.
key W
key W
tick
# Several keys in one tick: each kind of event in the order they happened.
key down ShiftLeft
key down W
key up ShiftLeft
key down Digit1
key up W
key up Digit1
tick
# Held, then up and down again: down, pressed and released.
key down W
tick
key up W
key down W
tick
# The commands run out: the window closes and releases W.
